== Description ==

'''Nails''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 47 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Ebony Wood]], [[Plank Wall]], [[Wood pillar]], [[Sloped Plank Roof]], [[Wood Grille]], [[Plank Roof]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

